# Line endings (#550).
#
# app/metric/[slug]/page.tsx and components/india-map.tsx had reached a MIXED state —
# 344 of 346 lines CRLF in one, 2199 of 2200 in the other — which is worse than either
# convention on its own: an LF-anchored patch matches the two odd lines and silently
# misses the rest of the file. It had already caused one half-applied edit.
#
# Normalising once fixes the files that exist; this fixes the ones that come next.
* text=auto eol=lf

# CSV keeps CRLF: RFC 4180 specifies it, and these are data artifacts, not source.
*.csv -text

# Never let git rewrite bytes in these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.db binary
*.gpkg binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
